# `rtok run` archives the fixture body; `expand --lines --grep` prints numbered hits (T60.2).

```console
$ SHELL=/bin/sh HOME=target/tmp/t60-2-expand RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t60-2-expand rtok --config tests/trycmd/input/json-readers.toml run -- cat tests/trycmd/input/expand-body.txt
...
$ SHELL=/bin/sh HOME=target/tmp/t60-2-expand RTOK_HOME=target/tmp/t60-2-expand rtok --config tests/trycmd/input/json-readers.toml expand 7efa1a3a0409e5d0933ec579cf4e8bfc2b78a481e1f91de9a927c7f4b71ba66e --lines 1-10 --grep "line 0"
1:line 01
2:line 02
3:line 03
4:line 04
5:line 05
6:line 06
7:line 07
8:line 08
9:line 09

```
